{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Mandatory 5-year minimum sentence for carrying any bladed weapon",
        "additional_details": "We believe knife crime is a huge problem throughout our country and following high-profile incidents in the news, I can see no reason as to why this law shouldn\u2019t be introduced.",
        "background": "We call on the Government to be firm and legislate to introduce a mandatory 5-year minimum custodial sentence for anyone found guilty of carrying any bladed weapon, including bladed weapons that are religious articles.",
